  "description": "Closed build evidence only; semantic checker must enforce clocks, bounds, exact file set, variant uniqueness/equivalence, wait/custody relations and COMPLETE_BUILD_PAIR gates. No field mints authority. Held/failed records preserve unobserved times/stream identities as null and uncertain reservation as UNESTABLISHED; complete results require all relevant actual facts nonnull under the semantic verifier. Revision01 requires inline bounded ordered custody observations, actual nullable cleanup-start and independently reconstructed command binding. Legacy summary fields cannot replace the journal. Full temporal/ordinal/projection semantics are specified by CUSTODY-CHRONOLOGY.md, not supplied trust flags.",
